          "quote": "我调取CareLoop联合医疗网络内这位患者的既往病历、用药记录、心脏相关检查或诊断记录"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 requires discovering non-volunteered but actionable facts. The doctor actively queried the workspace to uncover tetanus status, medication history, and prior processing records, and integrated these findings into the plan by advising the family to bring original images and clarify what was done.",
